WEBVTT

1
00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:14.898
song It was a nice day.

2
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:16.879
The pals were on a trail.

3
00:01:23.322 --> 00:01:24.402
Pink saw a snail.

4
00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:30.385
Then the day was gray.

5
00:01:30.405 --> 00:01:35.947
Green: Oh no!

6
00:01:36.447 --> 00:01:37.288
It will rain!

7
00:01:39.908 --> 00:01:41.149
Rain came down.

8
00:01:43.971 --> 00:01:45.111
The trail got wet.

9
00:01:46.992 --> 00:01:50.915
Pink: We must go home.

10
00:01:50.935 --> 00:01:57.799
Red: I see a rail.

11
00:01:57.819 --> 00:02:05.464
Yellow: Here comes a train.

12
00:02:08.432 --> 00:02:10.133
Blue: We must go fast.

13
00:02:13.475 --> 00:02:15.297
The pals ran to the train.

14
00:02:21.781 --> 00:02:24.783
Stop! The sun is out now!

15
00:02:24.803 --> 00:02:29.486
Pink: We can still play.

16
00:02:29.506 --> 00:02:30.087
Red: No.

17
00:02:31.007 --> 00:02:31.928
Let's go home.

18
00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:45.793
Green: We can play with clay.

19
00:02:47.675 --> 00:02:48.436
Pals: Yay!
